        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 1971P, Elite Collection Designer Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Designer Elite Door Pull is available in several stylish finish color options. Choose from 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. The Elite Collection Designer Pull is thru-bolt mounted for a secure and easy installation. This modern door pull is made by Omnia--a leader in stylish door hardware that exemplifies quality. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Designer Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>1971P/305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-11/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1971P/457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-9/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/16\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-designer-door-pull-set-omnia-btb-1971p\"><b> Omnia 1971P Designer Back-To-Back Pull Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
